    "description": "The List Weather Alerts Regions API provides users with the capability to access and manage regions that are associated with weather alerts. This endpoint allows developers and meteorological organizations to retrieve detailed information about specific regions experiencing weather alerts. Typical consumers of this API include weather service applications, emergency management systems, and other entities that require up-to-date weather-related information for decision-making purposes. Utilizing this API ensures that users stay informed about critical weather events affecting their areas of interest.",
